{"id":"481243","name":"培根萝卜汤","author":"馋嘴乐","authorId":"285245","desc":"","cover":"images/481243/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"500克"},{"name":"培根","amount":"50克"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"5克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"4克"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"10克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主辅料：培根、萝卜、粉丝","img":"images/481243/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把培根切条。","img":"images/481243/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"萝卜洗净切丝。","img":"images/481243/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热油，炒香葱花，放入萝卜丝炒匀。","img":"images/481243/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量蚝油。","img":"images/481243/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入清水，炖制5分钟左右，至萝卜熟透。","img":"images/481243/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入粉丝烧制1分钟。","img":"images/481243/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入培根。","img":"images/481243/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加少许盐调味。","img":"images/481243/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"烧开后，即可关火。","img":"images/481243/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅盛入碗中，即可上桌品味。","img":"images/481243/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"1、不喜欢粉丝的也可以不放，不影响味道。\n2、要把萝卜烧制到熟透才好。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}